"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":9163,"digest":"sha256:89c5888b96f575b5e40bcd3dd920571eb7e33b3b424424f861e798dc9dd74c6d","download_count":202,"created_at":"2025-07-29T05:53:30Z","updated_at":"2025-07-29T05:53:30Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/aio-libs/aiohttp/releases/download/v3.12.15/aiohttp-3.12.15.tar.gz.sigstore.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aio-libs/aiohttp/tarball/v3.12.15","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aio-libs/aiohttp/zipball/v3.12.15","body":"Bug fixes\n---------\n\n- Fixed :class:`~aiohttp.DigestAuthMiddleware` to preserve the algorithm case from the server's challenge in the authorization response. This improves compatibility with servers that perform case-sensitive algorithm matching (e.g., servers expecting ``algorithm=MD5-sess`` instead of ``algorithm=MD5-SESS``)\n  -- by :user:`bdraco`.\n\n\n  *Related issues and pull requests on GitHub:*\n  #11352.\n\n\n\n\nImproved documentation\n----------------------\n\n- Remove outdated contents of ``aiohttp-devtools`` and ``aiohttp-swagger``\n  from Web_advanced docs.\n  -- by :user:`Cycloctane`\n\n\n  *Related issues and pull requests on GitHub:*\n  #11347.\n\n\n\n\nPackaging updates and notes for downstreams\n-------------------------------------------\n\n- Started including the ``llhttp`` :file:`LICENSE` file in wheels by adding ``vendor/llhttp/LICENSE`` to ``license-files`` in :file:`setup.cfg` -- by :user:`threexc`.\n\n\n  *Related issues and pull requests on GitHub:*\n  #11226.\n