ha256:2c9914c8914ff40b68c6e4ed5da33e88d4e8f368fddd03ceb0eb3175905ca782","download_count":25,"created_at":"2025-06-04T16:21:34Z","updated_at":"2025-06-04T16:21:34Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/aio-libs/aiohttp/releases/download/v3.12.9/aiohttp-3.12.9.tar.gz"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aio-libs/aiohttp/tarball/v3.12.9","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aio-libs/aiohttp/zipball/v3.12.9","body":"Bug fixes\n---------\n\n- Fixed ``IOBasePayload`` and ``TextIOPayload`` reading entire files into memory when streaming large files -- by :user:`bdraco`.\n\n  When using file-like objects with the aiohttp client, the entire file would be read into memory if the file size was provided in the ``Content-Length`` header. This could cause out-of-memory errors when uploading large files. The payload classes now correctly read data in chunks of ``READ_SIZE`` (64KB) regardless of the total content length.\n\n\n  *Related issues and pull requests on GitHub:*\n  #11138.\n\n\n\n\n----","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aio-libs/aiohttp/releases/223130098/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aio-libs/aiohttp/releases/223015875","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aio-libs/aiohttp/releases/223015875/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/aio-libs/aiohttp/releases/223015875/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/aio-libs/aiohttp/releases/tag/v3.12.8","id":223015875,"author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/fol